  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T T.621 defines an interactive mobile comic and animation file structure used for organization and storage of mobile animation contents. It consists of a header, a resource file list, an asset list, an index of all movies and a movie list that contains animation and interactive attributes. This Recommendation can be used as a guideline for creation, processing, transmission and play of mobile animation contents.</abstract>
